                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's Tetris with more modes!\n\n+ Pros: Probably the best version of Tetris on Steam at the moment, and just because of its simplicity. The customization rocks, local multiplayer is awesome (can't comment on online multiplayer yet b/c no one's on), and it just functions like Tetris. Pretty cool extra modes with new mechanics, pieces, and more importantly, GARBAGE MODE (yay?)!\n- Cons: Primitive menus, animations outside of the main game seems out-of-place.\n\nLooking forward to what this game adds in the future.\n\nEdit: I initially thought you couldn't turn off ghost pieces, but there is an option to change the how the ghost piece looks/turn it off. However, there's a strange bug that always gives you ghost piece on your first piece, which is why testing if the setting worked or not was weird.\\\n\nEdit2: Thanks to the great communication from the dev, the bugs I found were fixed and more customization was added. Thanks!!",
                        "timestamp_created": 1547053337,
